+    /// <summary>
+    /// WS-C1 (spec §7 Q1) / D2: resolves the effective guardian-signature requirement, pre-fills
+    /// the <c>RequiresSignature</c> checkbox and the <c>Mandatory</c> lock, and feeds the
+    /// read-only policy row. Fail-open: an endpoint failure is a warning, the checkbox keeps its
+    /// value and stays ENABLED — a transport failure never locks an author out of their own
+    /// choice.
